here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"niṉ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிலைத்தார்","parts":[{"text":"சிலை","lemma":"cilai","gloss":"roar/sound"},{"text":"தார்","lemma":"tār","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"roaring"},{"surface":"முரசும்","parts":[{"text":"முரசு","lemma":"muracu","gloss":"drum"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"drum"},{"surface":"கறங்க","parts":[{"text":"கறங்கு","lemma":"kaṟaṅku","gloss":"sound/roar"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitival suffix"}],"gloss":"to roar"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மலைத்தனை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"fight/oppose"},{"text":"த்தனை","lemma":"ttaṉai","gloss":"you did"}],"gloss":"you fought"},{"surface":"எண்பது","parts":[{"text":"எண்பது","lemma":"eṉpatu","gloss":"to say so"}],"gloss":"to say so"},{"surface":"நாணுத்தகவு","parts":[{"text":"நாணு","lemma":"nāṇu","gloss":"shame"},{"text":"தகவு","lemma":"takavu","gloss":"fitness/nature"}],"gloss":"shameful nature"},{"surface":"உடைத்தே","parts":[{"text":"உடைத்து","lemma":"uṭaittu","gloss":"it has"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed has"}]}],"literal":"Whether you kill or whether you release / you measure and know your greatness, with your long shield! / Women with small bracelets and anklets containing red-streaked pebbles / playing with golden molucca beans on the raised platform, / scattering the white sand of the cool Porunai river, / as the long-handled axe, sharpened by the file of the strong-handed blacksmith, strikes, losing its stability, / the long branches fragrant with blossoms lamenting, in every grove / the sound of cutting down the guardian tree, in his town / within the limits of the tall walls, resounding in the guarded palace, / with that king who was sitting there comfortably, here, your / roaring drum sounding, / that you fought is indeed shameful!","translation":"Whether you choose to kill or to spare, you alone know the measure of your greatness, O king with the long leather shield! On the cool banks of the Porunai river, young women wearing small bracelets and anklets filled with red-streaked pebbles play with golden molucca beans on raised platforms, scattering the white sand. But now, as the long-handled axes, sharpened by the files of strong-handed blacksmiths, strike down the guardian trees, those trees lose their stability, and their long, flower-fragrant branches lament in every grove. The sound of this felling resounds within the tall walls of his guarded palace, where that king was sitting in comfort. That you have come here with your roaring drums to fight against such a helpless foe is indeed a matter of shame!","modern":"கொல்வதோ அல்லது விடுவிப்பதோ, நீண்ட கேடயத்தை உடையவனே, உன்னுடைய பெருமையை நீயே அளந்து அறிவாய்! சிவந்த வரிகளையும் பரல்களையும் உடைய சிலம்புகளையும், சிறிய வளையல்களையும் அணிந்த பெண்கள், குளிர்ந்த பொருநை ஆற்றின் வெண்மணல் சிதையுமாறு, திண்ணையின் மேல் பொன்னால் செய்த கழங்குகளைக் கொண்டு விளையாடுகிறார்கள். வலிமையான கைகளைக் கொண்ட கொல்லன் அரத்தால் கூர்மையாக்கிய, நீண்ட காம்பைக் கொண்ட கோடரி பாய்வதால், நிலை குலைந்து, மலர்கள் மணம் வீசும் நீண்ட கிளைகள் தனிமையால் வருந்த, சோலைகள் தோறும் காவல் மரங்களை வெட்டும் ஓசை கேட்கிறது. அந்த ஓசை, அவனது ஊரில் உள்ள உயர்ந்த மதில்களைக் கொண்ட காவல் அரண்மனையில் எதிரொலிக்கிறது. அங்கு இன்பமாக இருந்த அந்த அரசனோடு, இங்கு உன்னுடைய முரசுகள் முழங்க நீ போர் செய்வது வெட்கப்படத்தக்கது ஆகும்.","explanation":"The poet Alathur Kizhar addresses the Chola king Kulamuttrathu Thunjia Killi Valavan, who is besieging the capital of a rival king. The poet describes the beautiful, peaceful landscape of the enemy's country, where young women play happily on the sandy banks of the cool Porunai river. However, the Chola king's army is ruthlessly cutting down the enemy's sacred guardian trees (kaṭimaram) with sharp axes, causing the fragrant groves to lament. The sound of this destruction echoes inside the palace where the enemy king sits helplessly. The poet tells Killi Valavan that fighting against a king who is already so weakened and unable to defend his own sacred trees is not a matter of pride, but rather a shameful act.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.8],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,2.1],[2.1,2.4],[2.4,2.56],[2.56,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,3.9],[4.2,4.3],[4.3,5.9],[5.9,6.1],[6.1,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,8.4],[8.42,8.5],[8.5,9.4],[9.4,10.1],[10.1,10.6],[10.6,10.7],[10.7,12.0],[12.0,12.3],[12.3,12.48],[12.48,13.0],[13.0,13.9],[13.9,14.0],[14.0,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,14.9],[14.9,16.8],[16.8,16.8],[17.02,17.9],[18.68,19.28],[19.28,19.58],[19.58,19.78],[19.78,20.58],[20.58,21.18],[21.18,21.48],[21.48,21.98],[21.98,22.78],[22.78,23.62],[23.62,24.18],[24.18,24.38],[24.58,25.18],[25.38,26.08],[26.08,26.28],[26.28,26.68],[26.68,28.08],[28.08,28.98],[28.98,28.98],[28.98,29.68]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.57,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.57,2.0],[2.0,2.5],[2.5,3.36],[3.36,3.53],[3.53,3.53],[3.53,3.7],[4.38,4.6],[4.6,5.2],[5.2,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,7.2],[7.2,7.9],[7.9,8.1],[8.1,8.7],[8.7,9.2],[9.2,9.6],[9.6,10.4],[10.4,11.1],[11.1,11.2],[11.2,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,12.97],[13.13,13.8],[13.8,14.7],[14.7,15.0],[15.0,15.3],[15.3,15.9],[15.9,16.87],[16.87,17.11],[17.11,17.77],[18.43,19.1],[20.08,20.78],[20.78,21.18],[21.18,21.48],[21.48,22.08],[22.08,22.58],[22.58,22.98],[22.98,23.58],[23.58,24.48],[24.48,25.32],[25.32,25.88],[25.88,26.08],[26.08,26.08],[26.08,27.98],[27.98,28.18],[28.18,28.58],[28.58,30.18],[30.18,31.08],[31.08,31.08],[31.08,31.88]]}}